   "title": "EYE MAGIC",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>All 5 stereograms were shared across the @MarvelStudios, @Marvel and @CaptainMarvel social networks over the course of a week. The ’90s throwback garnered plenty of media attention and were featured across news platforms including Yahoo, Mashable, SyFy, Slash Film, PopSugar, Gizmodo and Fandango. Fans were ecstatic over the campaign generating one of the single most successful digital campaigns they had seen at the time.</p>"
